  m_text: 'You can change gravity with the GolfBallForceZone prefab.

    It is a
    bit of an experiment right now. It can cause weirdness with collisions/physics
    right now.

    Just place a collider, point it in the direction you want and
    change a couple settings and done :)

    This is what they look like in the
    Unity editor.'
