  m_text: 'This script comes with 2 functions


    SetColour() - Just sets the players
    colour to whatever the script is assigned to


    SetColourTo(Color) - Sets
    the players colour to whatever you pass into it as a Color type


    It can
    also set the colour when the player''s ball or club touches it.'
