  m_text: 'You can set up a course as a driving range.

    The purpose is just to
    see who can hit the ball the furthest.


    By default the speed of the club
    hits are clamped per club type. If you''d like to unclamp it untick the "Clamp
    Club Speed" tickbox on the course.'
