  m_text: "This is a bunch of perfectly aligned boxes. \nYour ball will probably
    bounce upwards after hitting an edge between the boxes. This is an issue within
    unity/physx that I've been spending a long time trying to get around.\n\nThe
    golf balls have code that tries to stick them to the ground when it makes sense
    to. It can't catch everything though unfortunately :("
