  m_text: 'A set of steps that take turns moving up and down to carry the ball up
    a level.


    Each step has a ball holder on its front edge (pictured). It''s
    solid while it touches the next step, holding the ball in place, and becomes
    a trigger once the next step drops below so the ball rolls on. The last one checks
    the exit floor.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
