  m_text: 'Add the floor/walls the SpinnyThing sits in to its Colliders To Ignore
    list so it can spin through them. Golf clubs are ignored automatically.


    I
    also limit the layers to these so only things on the pickup layers collide with
    the SpinnyThing. e.g. golf balls.'
