  m_text: 'There''s not many settings for this one.


    It only works with the
    Interact() function for simplicity.


    If the player is part way through a
    course, the ball button asks them to interact again to confirm skipping it. Desktop
    players are pointed to Ball Cam by the club button instead.


    If you want
    to make it work with physbones or some other way, you can just call the FetchItem()
    function on these scripts instead :)'
