      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'OpenPutt tries to make getting your club and ball easy by floating pickups
    above both of your shoulders


    <size=3>These 2 scripts gives players a place
    to go to spawn them in

    So people who struggle with the shoulder pickups
    have another option to get playing quicker


    Note: You don''t really need
    to place these everywhere. They''re more as a backup option for people who struggle
    grabbing behind their heads.'
