  m_text: 'When the ball enters the collider:

    - It will be sent to the position
    of the TeleportTarget object (yellow arrow)

    - Wait for however long you
    specify (the ball can be hidden while it waits)

    - Be launched from that
    position in the direction of LaunchTowards (grey arrow)


    Speed can either
    be maintained or set to a particular value in the script settings'
